# Allow-list build context: only what the images COPY. Keeps secrets, .env, trainer/, docs and tests out of every image
# and keeps the CDK asset hash stable.
*
!docker/Dockerfile
!docker/requirements-*.txt
!solution/a7
!solution/db
!solution/ingest
!data-room
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
solution/**/tests
.env
.env.*
**/.a7_vault_key
**/.DS_Store
